[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=ZeppBridge
GenericName=Zepp health data bridge
GenericName[zh_CN]=Zepp 健康数据桥
GenericName[es]=Pasarela de datos de salud de Zepp
GenericName[de]=Zepp-Gesundheitsdatenbrücke
GenericName[fr]=Passerelle de données de santé Zepp
GenericName[nl]=Zepp-gezondheidsdatabrug
GenericName[pt_BR]=Ponte de dados de saúde da Zepp
GenericName[pt_PT]=Ponte de dados de saúde da Zepp
GenericName[ru]=Мост данных о здоровье Zepp
GenericName[hi_IN]=Zepp स्वास्थ्य डेटा ब्रिज
GenericName[it]=Ponte per i dati sanitari Zepp
GenericName[pl]=Pomost danych zdrowotnych Zepp
Comment=View, archive and export your Amazfit health records on your own machine
Comment[zh_CN]=在自己的电脑上查看、归档和导出 Amazfit 健康记录
Comment[es]=Consulta, archiva y exporta tus registros de salud de Amazfit en tu propio ordenador
Comment[de]=Amazfit-Gesundheitsdaten auf dem eigenen Computer ansehen, archivieren und exportieren
Comment[fr]=Consultez, archivez et exportez vos données de santé Amazfit sur votre propre ordinateur
Comment[nl]=Bekijk, archiveer en exporteer je Amazfit-gezondheidsgegevens op je eigen computer
Comment[pt_BR]=Visualize, arquive e exporte seus registros de saúde da Amazfit no seu próprio computador
Comment[pt_PT]=Consulta, arquiva e exporta os teus registos de saúde da Amazfit no teu próprio computador
Comment[ru]=Просмотр, архивация и экспорт данных о здоровье Amazfit на вашем компьютере
Comment[hi_IN]=अपने कंप्यूटर पर Amazfit स्वास्थ्य रिकॉर्ड देखें, संग्रहीत करें और निर्यात करें
Comment[it]=Consulta, archivia ed esporta i dati sanitari Amazfit sul tuo computer
Comment[pl]=Przeglądaj, archiwizuj i eksportuj dane zdrowotne Amazfit na własnym komputerze
Exec=zeppbridge
Icon=com.zeppbridge.app
Terminal=false
# One main category only. Two of them (Utility;Science;) makes the app show up
# twice in some application menus. There is no Health or Fitness main category
# in the freedesktop spec, so the searchable words live in Keywords instead.
Categories=Utility;
Keywords=zepp;amazfit;huami;health;fitness;sleep;workout;heart rate;
Keywords[es]=zepp;amazfit;salud;fitness;sueño;entrenamiento;frecuencia cardíaca;
Keywords[de]=zepp;amazfit;gesundheit;fitness;schlaf;training;puls;herzfrequenz;
Keywords[fr]=zepp;amazfit;santé;forme;sommeil;entraînement;fréquence cardiaque;
Keywords[nl]=zepp;amazfit;gezondheid;fitness;slaap;training;hartslag;
Keywords[pt_BR]=zepp;amazfit;saúde;fitness;sono;treino;frequência cardíaca;
Keywords[pt_PT]=zepp;amazfit;saúde;fitness;sono;treino;frequência cardíaca;
Keywords[ru]=zepp;amazfit;здоровье;фитнес;сон;тренировки;пульс;
Keywords[hi_IN]=zepp;amazfit;स्वास्थ्य;फिटनेस;नींद;कसरत;हृदय गति;
Keywords[pl]=zepp;amazfit;zdrowie;fitness;sen;trening;tętno;
StartupWMClass=ZeppBridge
